{"run": "digest", "t": 24734, "kind": "dbg", "msg": "wiki: NOT COVERED [Disasters and accidents] Six people are missing and two others are found injured after a suspected gas leak causes an explosion and collapses a two-storey building in Plaka, Athens, Greece."}
